## `refute_with`

``` hol4
Refute.refute_with : config_update list -> term -> outcome
```

Searches for a counterexample to a term under per-call configuration
updates: `refute_with updates tm` abbreviates
`refute (current_config updates) tm`, where `current_config` applies the
updates to `!the_config` from left to right.  The goal form is
`refute_goal_with`.
See [`Refute.refute`](#Refute.refute), [`Refute.config`](#Refute.config).
